msgid "ReliefPlayer"
msgstr "ReliefPlayer"

msgid ""
"ReliefPlayer 是独立的 FLTK 本地音视频播放器，位于“网络和多媒体”应用分组， 不属于 ReliefOffice。使用系统中文字体和 "
"FLTK 默认 gtk+ 控件。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefPlayer is a standalone FLTK local audio/video player in the Network "
"and Multimedia applications group, outside ReliefOffice. It uses system "
"Chinese fonts and FLTK's default gtk+ widgets."

msgid ""
"点击“打开媒体”选择文件，打开后自动播放。支持播放/暂停、停止、拖动进度、 前后跳转 10 "
"秒、软件音量和静音。窗口显示文件名、格式、采样率、声道、位深、 已播放时间和总时长。MP4 视频在窗口中保持比例显示，支持常见的直角旋转元数据。 "
"文件管理器中的 MP3、WAV、MP4 默认使用本程序打开。"
msgstr ""
"Click Open Media to select a file; playback starts automatically. Controls "
"include play/pause, stop, seeking by dragging, ten-second backward/forward "
"jumps, software volume, and mute. The window shows filename, format, sample "
"rate, channels, bit depth, elapsed time, and duration. MP4 video keeps its "
"aspect ratio and supports common right-angle rotation metadata. The file "
"manager opens MP3, WAV, and MP4 with this program by default."

msgid "Ctrl+O：打开媒体。"
msgstr "Ctrl+O: open media."

msgid "空格：播放或暂停。"
msgstr "Space: play or pause."

msgid "左右方向键：前后跳转 10 秒。"
msgstr "Left/right arrows: jump backward/forward 10 seconds."

msgid "Home：回到开头。"
msgstr "Home: return to the beginning."

msgid ""
"音量只影响本程序输出，不更改系统混音器。暂停和停止会释放音频设备； 恢复播放从已经播放到的位置继续，停止后再次播放从开头开始。 "
"设备被其他程序占用或不可用时会在状态栏提示，可以释放设备后重试播放。"
msgstr ""
"Volume affects only this program's output, not the system mixer. Pause and "
"Stop release the audio device. Resuming continues from the played position; "
"playing after Stop starts from the beginning. A busy or unavailable device "
"is reported in the status bar; release it and retry playback."

msgid "支持范围"
msgstr "Supported Formats and Features"

msgid ""
"MP3 使用仓库已有 minimp3，支持单/双声道 MPEG Layer III，包括可变码率。 "
"首次打开扫描帧索引以确定总时长，定位时预解码恢复状态。时间按音频帧统计， 不裁切编码器延迟和尾部 padding。会跳过 ID3 和 APEv2 "
"标签边界， 不读取封面或展示标签信息。 APEv2 边界布局参考 `FFmpeg 的官方实现 "
"<https://www.ffmpeg.org/doxygen/4.2/apetag_8c_source.html>`_。"
msgstr ""
"MP3 uses the repository's existing minimp3, supporting mono/stereo MPEG "
"Layer III including variable bitrates. Initial opening scans a frame index "
"to determine duration; seeking predecodes to restore state. Timing counts "
"audio frames without trimming encoder delay or trailing padding. ID3 and "
"APEv2 tag boundaries are skipped; cover art and tag information are not read"
" or displayed. APEv2 boundary layout follows `FFmpeg's official "
"implementation <https://www.ffmpeg.org/doxygen/4.2/apetag_8c_source.html>`_."

msgid ""
"WAV 支持 RIFF 中的单/双声道 PCM 8、16、24、32 位和 IEEE float32； 支持容器位深与有效位深相同的对应 "
"WAVE_FORMAT_EXTENSIBLE 子格式。 采样率范围 8–192 kHz，不支持其他 WAV 压缩编码、RF64 或多声道源文件。 "
"最多打开 2 GiB 的文件；MP3 索引最多 100 万帧。"
msgstr ""
"WAV supports mono/stereo PCM 8, 16, 24, and 32-bit and IEEE float32 in RIFF,"
" plus corresponding WAVE_FORMAT_EXTENSIBLE subformats whose container and "
"valid bit depths match. Sample rates are 8–192 kHz. Other WAV compression, "
"RF64, and multichannel sources are unsupported. Files are limited to 2 GiB "
"and MP3 indexes to one million frames."

msgid ""
"MP4 使用锁定的官方 FFmpeg 8.1.3 LGPL 精简共享库，支持 H.264、MPEG-4 Part 2、 HEVC 视频及 AAC、MP3"
" 音轨；音频最多 8 声道，转换为 48 kHz 立体声。 无音轨的视频使用单调时钟播放，不需要打开音频设备。含音轨的视频按音频设备 "
"已经播放的帧同步画面，定位会刷新解码器并丢弃关键帧到目标位置之间的预解码数据。 不支持的编码、损坏文件和解码失败会报告错误。"
msgstr ""
"MP4 uses pinned official FFmpeg 8.1.3 LGPL reduced shared libraries, "
"supporting H.264, MPEG-4 Part 2, and HEVC video with AAC or MP3 audio. Up to"
" eight audio channels are converted to 48 kHz stereo. Video without audio "
"uses a monotonic clock and does not open an audio device. Video with audio "
"synchronizes to frames already played by the audio device; seeking flushes "
"decoders and discards predecoded data between the keyframe and target. "
"Unsupported codecs, damaged files, and decoding failures report errors."

msgid ""
"视频使用软件解码，源画面最多 4096 × 2160，显示快照最多 1280 × 720 像素 （竖屏时可交换边长）。不含硬件加速、HDR "
"色调映射、字幕或多音轨选择； 高分辨率视频的流畅程度取决于虚拟机性能。"
msgstr ""
"Video decoding is software-based, with source frames limited to 4096 × 2160 "
"and display snapshots to 1280 × 720 pixels (dimensions may swap for "
"portrait). Hardware acceleration, HDR tone mapping, subtitles, and multiple-"
"audio-track selection are absent; high-resolution smoothness depends on VM "
"performance."

msgid ""
"``make fetch`` 下载锁定源码，``upstream-ffmpeg`` 离线构建五个解码共享库。 播放器启用时，运行库及 LGPL 许可证随"
" ``reliefos-media-codecs`` APK 一起进入镜像； 开发头文件留在独立构建目录。库名及 SONAME 带有 "
"``-reliefplayer`` 后缀， 可以与 Alpine 的完整 FFmpeg/VLC 依赖共存。FFmpeg "
"不构建命令行程序、网络协议或外部编码器。"
msgstr ""
"``make fetch`` downloads pinned sources; ``upstream-ffmpeg`` builds five "
"decoding shared libraries offline. With the player enabled, runtime "
"libraries and LGPL licenses enter the image in the ``reliefos-media-codecs``"
" APK; development headers remain in a separate build directory. Library "
"names and SONAMEs carry a ``-reliefplayer`` suffix to coexist with Alpine's "
"full FFmpeg/VLC dependencies. FFmpeg builds no command-line programs, "
"network protocols, or external encoders."

msgid ""
"解码、文件读取和音频写入由独立子进程执行，GUI 通过非阻塞管道控制。 视频通过有界共享内存发布 RGB 快照，GUI "
"保存自己的画面副本；双方只尝试获取 复制锁，不等待对方，也不在锁内读文件或解码。 采样率和设备不同时使用线性插值；设备输出为 "
"S16_LE，使用前置立体声， 额外硬件声道置零。非阻塞短写、设备回压和排空均保留未完成数据； 播放失败不会把进度伪装为完成。设备连续 5 "
"秒既无写入也无播放进展时报告错误。 结尾通过非阻塞补齐硬件周期和查询剩余队列排空，期间仍响应控制命令。"
msgstr ""
"A separate child process handles decoding, file reads, and audio writes, "
"controlled by the GUI through nonblocking pipes. Video publishes RGB "
"snapshots through bounded shared memory; the GUI keeps its own frame copy. "
"Both sides only try to acquire the copy lock, never wait for one another, "
"and do not read files or decode under the lock. Linear interpolation is used"
" when source and device sample rates differ. Device output is S16_LE on "
"front stereo channels, with extra hardware channels zeroed. Nonblocking "
"short writes, backpressure, and draining preserve unfinished data. Playback "
"failures never disguise progress as complete. Five continuous seconds with "
"neither writing nor playback progress produces an error. At the end, "
"nonblocking padding to hardware periods and remaining-queue queries drain "
"output while control commands remain responsive."

msgid "本版只播放单个本地文件，不含播放列表、网络串流、均衡器或媒体库。"
msgstr ""
"This version plays one local file at a time, without playlists, network "
"streaming, an equalizer, or a media library."
